{"game": "space-marine-2011", "language": "english", "appid": 55150, "month": "2021-06", "window": 3, "start_date": 1623801600, "end_date": 1624406399, "month_true_total": 237, "quota": 5, "returned": 5, "pulled_at": "2026-10-09 18:00:22 UTC", "reviews": [{"recommendationid": "94186980", "author": {"steamid": "76561198031328124", "personaname": "Rizilliant", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198031328124/", "num_games_owned": 326, "num_reviews": 390, "playtime_forever": 675, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 90, "last_played": 1631979009, "avatar": "4cb7b9942d01111c131ad08deebaed7365afd798"}, "language": "english", "review": "Such a shame, they didnt make more of this. (insane dlc bloat, aside) I bought this when it released, back on the ps3, and couldnt stop playing it. \n\nThis is the only 40k game of this type, and they nailed it!  Even the multiplayer was fun. though they made so many modes, the community was too fractured, which causes it to die off quickly. Also turned Lascannons into sniper rifles for some silly reason.\n\nOn the down side, I got to the Orc boss fight, and the game became a slideshow. Whenever I swung my melee, the game would stop, for 5 to 10 full seconds. Game is old, so it runs beautifully, other than that.\n\nPLEASE, for the love of the EMPRAH, make a part 2!", "timestamp_created": 1624396814, "timestamp_updated": 1631979714, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.263689011335372925", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1315281600", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "94173398", "author": {"steamid": "76561199101405712", "personaname": "2dogs", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199101405712/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 32, "